        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin PD006-PRIV, Large Santa Monica Mortise Pocket Door Privacy Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 8.3 Inch Santa Monica Pocket Door Privacy Set comes with two pulls and a mortise lock that can be thrown and retracted by either the thumbturn on the interior or by turning the node on the exterior. This lockset is for privacy only and can be unlocked from the outside in case of an emergency. It can be used on doors that have a 2-1/2 inch backset that are at least 1.5 inches thick. Choose from several beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/large-santa-monica-pocket-door-passage-set-baldwin-pd005-pass\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/large-santa-monica-pocket-door-keyed-entry-baldwin-pd005-entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Santa Monica Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 8.3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .15\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 6.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Depth: .29\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: 1.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Height: 6-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Depth: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Edge Face Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Edge Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/baldwin-8602-template.pdf?v=1691094971\" target=\"new\"><b>Baldwin Mortise Lock Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-PD005-specifications.gif?v=1704354560\" width=\"174\" height=\"264\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin PD005 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
